## About

This project is a personal website mockup inspired by the design and atmosphere of 0xploit.net.

It was created for learning, experimentation and practicing web development.

## Features

* Modern and minimalist design
* Responsive layout
* Custom animations
* Interactive elements
* Music player
* Personal portfolio style

## Technologies

* HTML5
* CSS3
* JavaScript

